      "example": "true",
      "help_en": "Specifies whether to perform a dry run for this request.\n\nA dry run checks parameter validity and resource availability without actually creating instances or incurring charges.\n\nValid values:\n\ntrue: Sends a dry run request without creating instances.\n\nfalse (default): Sends a normal request and creates instances after the request passes the check",
